## Release information

This panel displays the last release metadata reported by the service.

- Version: ${service.version}  
- Commit: ${service.commit}  
- Last successful deploy: ${service.last_successful_deploy}  
- Last failed deploy: ${service.last_failed_deploy}

Note: populate variables via the API endpoint `/api/v1/info` in your dashboard using a simple frontend or datasource plugin.
